strengths.value:
1. This paper re-examines existing model merging methods, highlighting the critical role of parameter competition awareness;
2. This paper introduce a novel approach called PCB-MERGING, which effectively adjusts parameter coefficients through balancing parameter competition; 
3. The method stabilizes and enhances model merging performance across various application scenarios without additional training.

